  "reel": {
    "script": "Photography might just save endangered species. Here's how. With so many creatures at risk, how do we get people to care? Joel Sartore's Photo Ark project has documented over eighteen thousand species. His portraits show their beauty and vulnerability. That's changing how we see and value these creatures. The Photo Ark is over halfway to its goal of twenty-five thousand species. By highlighting their beauty, Sartore's work reminds us to protect Earth's biodiversity. What's one endangered species you think more people should know about?",
